  {
   "text": "(1) The first view is that amongst the three signs deduct the figure of least ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    57,
    556,
    73
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "number of bindus in a sign from the figures of bindus of the other two signs. In the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    82,
    556,
    97
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun's Ashtakavarga Aries has 3 bindus, Leo 5 and Sagittarius 4. Amongst these ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    106,
    556,
    121
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "three signs Aries has the least number of bindus. Deduct this from the figures of ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    130,
    556,
    145
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Leo's bindus viz., 5 i.e. 5-3=2. Similarly deduct 3 from 4 the figure of bindus of ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    154,
    556,
    169
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sagittarius, that is 4-3=1. In Aries there will be 3-3=0",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    178,
    385,
    194
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Similarly in the next set of triangular signs Taurus, Virgo and Capricorn, ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    202,
    556,
    218
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Taurus has 7 bindus, Virgo 3 and Capricorn 3. Virgo and Capricorn has the least ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    226,
    556,
    242
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "number of bindus. Thus as result of trikona sodhana Taurus will have 7-3=4 ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    251,
    556,
    266
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "bindus, Virgo 3-3=0 bindus and Capricorn 3-3=0 bindus.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    275,
    403,
    290
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "As regards Gemini, Libra and Aquarius, Gemini has 4, Libra 4 and Aquarius ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    299,
    556,
    314
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "6 in the Sun's Ashtakavarga. Gemini and Libra have the least number of bindus. ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    323,
    556,
    339
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Therefore as a result of trikona sodhana Aquarius will have 5-4=1, Libra 4-4=0 and ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    347,
    556,
    363
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Gemini 4-4 = 0 bindus.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    371,
    215,
    387
   ]
  },
