  },
  {
   "text": "In the fourth set of triangular signs in the the Sun's Ashtakavarga, Cancer has ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    577,
    556,
    593
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "4, Scorpio 5 and Pisces 1. Pisces has the Least number of bindus. Therefore as a ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    601,
    556,
    617
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "result of trikona sodhana. Cancer will be 4-1=3, Scorpio 5-1=4 and Pisces 1-1=0 ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    626,
    556,
    641
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "bindus.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    650,
    126,
    665
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Thus the following principles are to be observed in trikona sodhana:—",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    674,
    517,
    689
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(a) Of the three triangular signs, the figure of the sign having the least ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    698,
    556,
    714
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "number of bindus, has to be deducted from the figures of all the signs and the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    722,
    556,
    738
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "remainder will represent the final rectified figure of the signs.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    746,
    430,
    762
   ]
  },
